l three files contribute. But lib/b.dart has no code, so its contribution is 0. Only lib/a.dart and the imported file (lib/c.dart) have policies. So the total is 61 (from lib/c.dart) + 0 (from lib/b.dart) + 0 (from lib/a.dart) = 61 seconds.\n\nBut wait, the user might be considering all three files. However, lib/b.dart has no code, so its contribution is 0. So the total is 61 seconds.\n"},{"role":"user","content":"If retryCount were changed to 8 and maxDelay to 30, what would the total wait be? Work it out from what you already read; do not call tools."}]}